  43:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/SupportFunctions/arm_q7_to_q15.c **** /**
  44:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/SupportFunctions/arm_q7_to_q15.c ****  * @brief Converts the elements of the Q7 vector to Q15 vector.
  45:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/SupportFunctions/arm_q7_to_q15.c ****  * @param[in]       *pSrc points to the Q7 input vector
  46:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/SupportFunctions/arm_q7_to_q15.c ****  * @param[out]      *pDst points to the Q15 output vector
  47:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/SupportFunctions/arm_q7_to_q15.c ****  * @param[in]       blockSize length of the input vector
  48:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/SupportFunctions/arm_q7_to_q15.c ****  * @return none.
  49:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/SupportFunctions/arm_q7_to_q15.c ****  *
  50:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/SupportFunctions/arm_q7_to_q15.c ****  * \par Description:
  51:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/SupportFunctions/arm_q7_to_q15.c ****  *
  52:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/SupportFunctions/arm_q7_to_q15.c ****  * The equation used for the conversion process is:
  53:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/SupportFunctions/arm_q7_to_q15.c ****  *
  54:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/SupportFunctions/arm_q7_to_q15.c ****  * <pre>
  55:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/SupportFunctions/arm_q7_to_q15.c ****  * 	pDst[n] = (q15_t) pSrc[n] << 8;   0 <= n < blockSize.
  56:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/SupportFunctions/arm_q7_to_q15.c ****  * </pre>
  57:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/SupportFunctions/arm_q7_to_q15.c ****  *
  58:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/SupportFunctions/arm_q7_to_q15.c ****  */
  59:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/SupportFunctions/arm_q7_to_q15.c **** 
  60:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/SupportFunctions/arm_q7_to_q15.c **** 
